                       mirror any stylesheet (assetsbundle.run_rtlcss shells out to that binary).
2026-09-14 | NOTE | `res_lang.active` is a NULLABLE boolean and the Arabic rows hold **NULL**, not false.
                       Odoo's ORM reads NULL as "not active" (`active_test` matches active=true), so the
                       app behaves correctly — but a raw SQL check written as `where active = false`
                       or `where not active` will MISS these rows, because NULL fails both comparisons.
                       ACC-E02 (activating ar_001) and its verification must use `coalesce(active,false)`
                       or `active is true`, never `= false`. 93 languages exist; exactly 1 is active.

