2026-09-15 | FALSIFIABILITY | fix reverted, module upgraded, guard re-run -> FAILED and caught the real request: stack "...Odoo Unicode Support Noto...", off-instance requests 1 -> `font https://fonts.odoocdn.com/fonts/noto/NotoSansArabic-Reg.woff2`, exit 1. Restored; guard OK again. Genuine red->green: 1 CDN request -> 0, the request OBSERVED not inferred.
