2026-09-15 | DECISION | C02 reads the cookie instead of `return 'dark'`. The bundle is chosen server-side and the cookie is read for it nowhere in community, so a bare hardcode would have made C04's toggle silently do nothing: write cookie, reload, server says dark again. This is NOT the rejected "follow the system preference" variant — nothing reads prefers-color-scheme; only our own cookie is honoured.
